    "title": "Police: Orbeez toy gun used in Trent Woods shooting involving juveniles - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Emilia Paz ,\n1 days ago Police in Trent Woods say two juveniles and an 18-year-old were taken into custody after a man was shot with a toy gun that fired Orbeez water beads Monday morning. According to the Trent Woods Police Department, the incident happened around 11:30 a.m. near West Watercreek Drive and Trent Woods Drive. Investigators say two brothers, ages 9 and 13, were riding in a vehicle driven by an 18-year-old friend when they fired the toy gun at a man walking along the roadway. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
